{"type":"after","callId":"jgqi@1343","endTime":309521.932,"result":{"value":"All projects\nWEB EXPERIENCE / 05\nBeliri.\n\nA fashion storefront with promotional campaigns, category discovery, and product-led browsing.\n\nPROJECT TYPE\nWeb & web apps\nFOCUS\nFashion & commerce\nORIGINAL PROJECT ARTWORK\nOverview\nKey features\nDesign\nScreenshots\nDevice views\n01\nPROJECT OVERVIEW\nLet the collection take the lead.\n\nBeliri’s website places fashion photography at the center of its storefront. Campaign banners introduce collections, while category navigation and shopping entry points support the move from browsing imagery to exploring products. The portfolio includes desktop page designs and a companion mobile application.\n\n02\nKEY FEATURES\nA closer look at\nthe experience.\n\nThe flows and interface elements visible in Beliri's original project material.\n\n01\nCollection campaigns\n\nLarge promotional panels introduce featured fashion collections.\n\n02\nCategory discovery\n\nProduct categories organize the storefront’s browsing paths.\n\n03\nProduct browsing\n\nImage-led sections give products a prominent place in the layout.\n\n04\nAccount entry\n\nThe supplied navigation includes customer account access.\n\n03\nDESIGN DIRECTION\nIts own identity.\nIn every detail.\nFashion & commerce\n\nA black-and-white brand frame lets editorial photography carry the color. Wide campaign panels, simple navigation, and generous product imagery establish a retail experience that feels consistent across the supplied device presentations.\n\nDesign observations from the supplied project artwork.\n04\nUI SCREENSHOTS & ARTWORK\nInside Beliri.\n\nExplore the original interface screens. Select any image for a closer look.\n\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n01\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n02\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n03\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n04\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n05\n05\nRESPONSIVE DESIGN PRESENTATION\nA view across\nthe original devices.\n\nBeliri's original portfolio composition presents the website on laptop and tablet devices. The artwork below preserves those supplied layouts together, with their original proportions.\n\nThese are source mockups of the project, rather than a new rendering of its live website.\n\nBeliri / Original device composition\nSOURCE MATERIAL\n\nProject descriptions are based on the published artwork and available overview. Interface observations do not imply verified implementation details or measured business results.\n\nOriginal project page\nNEXT WEB PROJECT\nPrintlific\nKEEP EXPLORING\nMore perspectives.\nView all work\nPHOTOGRAPHY & COMMERCE\nPrintlific\nTALENT & RECRUITMENT\nNerdrabbit\nCHILDCARE & DISCOVERY\nParachute\nHAVE A PROJECT IN MIND?\nLet's make your\nnext idea real.\nBook a free consultation"}}
